WEBVTT

00:10:03.015 --> 00:10:04.975
Most of epigenetic research

00:10:05.017 --> 00:10:08.395
has really focused
on stress, anxiety, depression --

00:10:08.395 --> 00:10:09.855
kind of a downer,

00:10:09.897 --> 00:10:11.106
kind of bad things.

00:10:11.148 --> 00:10:12.149
(Laughter)

00:10:12.191 --> 00:10:13.776
But nowadays --

00:10:13.776 --> 00:10:14.985
the latest stuff --

00:10:15.027 --> 00:10:16.654
people are looking at relaxation.

00:10:16.654 --> 00:10:18.906
Can that have a positive
effect on your DNA?

00:10:20.199 --> 00:10:23.327
Right now we're missing
key data from mice models.

00:10:24.662 --> 00:10:26.080
We know that mice relax,

00:10:26.121 --> 00:10:30.084
but could they meditate
like the Dalai Lama?